Z||000003||FieroJoe||12-29-2000||11:30 AM||||haha, that reminds me of a story that my friend told me.  His friend has an old beater ford pickup, and he wired his back-up lights to a switch, so he could turn them on at any time.  While driving downtown, he had been taunting this corvette between lights.  Well, eventually, the corvette was behind him at a light, and was pulled up right next to the trucks bumper, just to piss him off i guess....anyway, the guy turned on his backup lights, and the corvette owner got scared and  gunned it in reverse, destroying his corvette's rear end into some other poor car.||||reg||1
