Z||000026||SlowAltimaOwner||01-24-2001||10:12 AM||||I understand how you feel after the MR2 incident. But we have a board too, and we know how it feels after beating an SI for someone to come on your board and start talking crap, so I'm not doing that.<P>the specs for the average altima stock is:<BR>HP flywheel 150<BR>HP wheels 122<BR>torque wheels 121<BR>1/4 mile 15.9 @ 89 mph<BR>0-60, not sure, but guessing maybe 8 or 9 sec.<P>turbo is running 202 HP and 212 TQ at the wheels<BR>1/4 mile 14.5<P>These are averages, so you can't tell who's lying about it.<P>If you want to make your MR2 buddies look bad, how about a video of one getting beat by an altima, let me know I have the file, I'll send it to 1FST2M6<BR><P>------------------<BR>Hey, wanna race?<P>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1437138&a=10775600&p=38987767">  <BR>Well you didn't have to be so harsh, you could've just said NO!!||||reg||1
